server.detail:
Now refuses:
- a different learner: 403 when row.learner is set and X-Learner differs;
- not begun: 409 'press Begin first';
- paused: 409 'paused';
- remaining() < −15s grace on a timed sitting: 409 'time is up'. Today the server accepts answers after time.
Grid-in shape is validated: ^-?[0-9./]{1,5}$ with at most one . or /, otherwise 422 'not a grid-in answer'.
It stores qstate[qid].first (the first non-null answer) and qstate[qid].changes += 1 when the value changes.

Returns:
- estimate: {latest, previous, delta, best, combined (≥2 sections: mean midpoint ± 70/√n, rounded to 10, over the last 3), count}
- target, exam {date, days}
- up_next: {kind, reason: 'resume'|'plan'|'new'|'default', session?}
- in_progress: [the history row shape]
- kinds: [{id: 'section'|'module1'|'module2u'|'module2l'|'custom'|'diagnostic', everyone: N finished, yours: n, last, best, percentile (null below 30 scored sittings of that kind; % of other sittings whose midpoint is below yours)}]
- twin: {source, label} or null.
One round trip for /tests/.

New checks:
- begin and pause semantics;
- questions withheld before begin;
- answers refused before begin, while paused and after time (by moving module_started back in the DB);
- qstate round trip, with no key leak;
- the module 2 clock NULL until begin;
- m1 upper tier counts 3/8/11 and scored false;
- twin slot-by-slot equality;
- x1.5 and x2 durations;
- history all=1 statuses and modules;
- discard excluded;
- report stored with template and seed, with 422 and 429 limits;
- a foreign learner gets 403.
